  "revenuesystem_visual_authority_rule": "RevenueSystem Chief Operator Experience & UX Authority v2 has highest precedence for usability, operator workflow, simplification, layout, density, navigation, interaction, keyboard, focus and cognitive load, but major structural decisions must carry evidence. Visual Art Director owns aesthetic expression within UX-approved constraints. WPF Design Systems implements approved composition. Independent Visual QA may reject fidelity or usability defects. Finance, data integrity, security, accessibility and architecture remain hard constraints; Owner remains final authority.",
